{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Such a principal’s record lives in its organization’s reserved tenant, so its global"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"grants apply in every tenant of that organization, and it can act on a different one"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by sending a different "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"X-Axiam-Tenant"},{"type":"text","text":" on the next request — no re-login, because it"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"already is a principal of every tenant there."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An ordinary tenant principal is a principal of exactly one tenant; the same header"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"change produces a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"403"},{"type":"text","text":" for it. This flag is therefore what an application checks"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"before"}]},{"type":"text","text":" offering a tenant switch, rather than discovering the answer from a failed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Derived, never asserted","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" (§5.2 rule 2): resolved server-side from the caller’s own"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tenant record, and never sent by this SDK. "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" when the login response omits it —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what a server older than contract 1.31 answers — and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" on the guard"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"path, where this value is built from token claims that do not carry it. Both are the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"safe direction: the application then offers no cross-tenant action."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Since contract 1.35 that reach can be narrowed per assignment, so this flag alone no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"longer decides what to offer: consult "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" as well (§5.2.3 rule 3)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel"]}],"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK","doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"abstract":[{"text":"Whether this is an ","type":"text"},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"organization-level","type":"text"}]},{"text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2).","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"title":"organizationLevel","externalID":"s:8AxiamSDK0A4UserV17organizationLevelSbvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"AxiamSDK"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"references":{"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/reachableTenantIDs":{"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"reachableTenantIDs","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/reachabletenantids","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reachableTenantIDs","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"String","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":"]?","kind":"text"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The tenants this caller’s roles reach, when they are narrowed (§5.2.3)."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/reachableTenantIDs","type":"topic"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The official Swift SDK for AXIAM (Access eXtended Identity and Authorization Management)."}],"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk","title":"AxiamSDK","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK"},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser":{"title":"AxiamUser","url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"An authenticated AXIAM identity."}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser","role":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AxiamUser","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://AxiamSDK/documentation/AxiamSDK/AxiamUser/organizationLevel":{"url":"\/documentation\/axiamsdk\/axiamuser\/organizationlevel","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/AxiamSDK\/documentation\/AxiamSDK\/AxiamUser\/organizationLevel","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"organizationLevel","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Whether this is an "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"organization-level","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" principal (CONTRACT.md §5.2)."}],"title":"organizationLevel"}}}